{%- comment -%}
  Đồng bộ nút mua sang đỏ rượu #6b2429 (chỉ ở mẫu product.kinh):
  - Nút "COMPRAR AHORA" chính (#cod-open của snippets/cod-form), kiểu góc vuông, chữ trắng đậm.
  - Nút "Comprar ahora" trên thanh mua cố định (sticky-buy-bar) ở đáy màn hình.
  Chỉ có CSS. Không sửa cod-form.liquid hay sticky-buy-bar.liquid.
  Muốn bỏ: xóa dòng gọi snippet này khỏi mẫu kinh.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if template.suffix == 'kinh' %}
<style>
/* NÚT COD CHÍNH */

cod-form #cod-open.button {
  --buttons-radius: 0px;
  --buttons-radius-outset: 0px;
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  gap: 2px !important;
  width: 100% !important;
  min-height: 62px !important;
  padding: 16px 20px !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: #6b2429 !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
  text-align: center !important;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .2s ease !important;
}

cod-form #cod-open.button::before,
cod-form #cod-open.button::after {
  display: none !important;
  content: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}

cod-form #cod-open.button:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: #561c20 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}

cod-form #cod-open.button:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #D3A976 !important;
  outline-offset: 3px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}

cod-form #cod-open.button:disabled {
  opacity: .55;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

cod-form #cod-open .cod-open__title {
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  font-size: 16px !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
  letter-spacing: 0 !important;
}

cod-form #cod-open .cod-open__subtitle {
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  font-size: 13px !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
  opacity: .92 !important;
}

/* NÚT TRÊN THANH MUA CỐ ĐỊNH (STICKY BUY BAR) */

sticky-buy-bar .button.button--primary {
  --color-button: 107, 36, 41;
  --color-button-text: 255, 255, 255;
  background-color: #6b2429 !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
}

sticky-buy-bar .button.button--primary:hover {
  background-color: #561c20 !important;
}

@media (max-width: 749px) {
  cod-form #cod-open.button {
    min-height: 56px !important;
    padding: 14px !important;
  }

  cod-form #cod-open .cod-open__title {
    font-size: 14px !important;
  }

  cod-form #cod-open .cod-open__subtitle {
    font-size: 12px !important;
  }
}
</style>
{% endif %}